    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Rainy_Day_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey! I had trouble sleeping last night so I fiddled around in my workshop for a bit. Here, I made this for you. [688 369 338 325 287]#$e#I hope you can find some use for it.",
      "translation": "Ahoj! Včera v noci jsem nemohla spát, tak jsem chvíli kutila v dílně. Tady, tohle jsem pro tebe vyrobila. [688 369 338 325 287]#$e#Doufám, že pro to najdeš nějaké využití.",
      "sourceSHA256": "a038e7b7b0d05faa219ff88a7f98dcbf534db1f01c3be196d23a1781c152b29d",
      "translationSHA256": "7c5d57adeb9e5caebadebb42b87b6e2719aae591edf18e41998727898f364f77",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
