    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_5",
      "field": null,
      "source": "My day wasn't all that exciting... I stayed inside because of the weather.#$e#It was relaxing, though. I kicked back with the latest 'Schematics Weekly'.",
      "translation": "Můj den nebyl nijak zvlášť vzrušující... Kvůli počasí jsem zůstala doma.#$e#Odpočinula jsem si ale. Uvelebila jsem se s nejnovějším číslem ‚Týdeníku schémat‘.",
      "sourceSHA256": "9c2cfbce48538cdad084e62faab0a0856773c11632cc2856fe3166a6b36ac434",
      "translationSHA256": "c23b45cca1512d5bb59afdfaaffb41eeab53e186ec38e36f25174b220c28825d",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hmm? Sorry, sometimes I get so lost in thought that I don't even realize what I'm doing.",
      "translation": "Hmm? Promiň, někdy se tak hluboce zamyslím, že si ani neuvědomuji, co dělám.",
      "sourceSHA256": "0ba6a82ccca02832f71e621a15e403f0aba48e7d20b611cf4a09fa75fd356596",
      "translationSHA256": "741c2cc2ebc08514242ea91c75f729df027b2da511a2fb7c0edaa932ea03113e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I found this in my scrap pile. Think you could find a use for it? [286 287 205 732]",
      "translation": "Tohle jsem našla na hromadě šrotu. Myslíš, že pro to najdeš využití? [286 287 205 732]",
      "sourceSHA256": "17f483d1b8fea5a5902dd853c8842cd412bb9ee3b14487e7fdea0d7878ad7eeb",
      "translationSHA256": "90d876bcee7a49996d60e74ca61d8f7b9a6a28d215f5969ff936942130c0b581",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Finally, you're up! I was getting so hungry... *rumble*$h",
      "translation": "Konečně jsi vzhůru! Začínala jsem mít hrozný hlad... *zakručení v břiše*$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "e51766608484c418b74fd09cbda606c32ae3cfe0e3d547f952807596116e4029",
      "translationSHA256": "fa354c198c7e55acb5d85d8e3097d2504ddda9dead5622eb9ddcc7d139a7bb86",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "One of the best things about living on the farm is waking up to a chorus of songbirds.",
      "translation": "Jednou z nejlepších věcí na životě na farmě je probouzet se do zpěvu celého ptačího sboru.",
      "sourceSHA256": "b1d4a601fcddf7afe6a1c0b84588b27f908bc2454c72f43526db15d6e8bba6eb",
      "translationSHA256": "610827fb7cc9db16acf338761121871b5e4a9a104164d7bfb0d588e12649d37e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "How do you keep your hands so soft with all that farm work?",
      "translation": "Jak si při vší té práci na farmě udržuješ tak jemné ruce?",
      "sourceSHA256": "0c0350c825c539081045dee12c0e2216ea3cabf9855ad009552ed5651e0ee522",
      "translationSHA256": "e54539eb244b280d43be9a04ec2c2db07b4664067aea839116d59855f2c192b6",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Did you see the moon tonight? It always looks spectacular on the horizon.",
      "translation": "Je dnes vidět měsíc? Na obzoru vždycky vypadá úchvatně.",
      "sourceSHA256": "d0a88fde2b6d425741003be9553a97b73f8d28a3e7bbd2156b10a84bf1dbc0ba",
      "translationSHA256": "0892dda9d642f8958a936cbffa3b116402d0a4e795af47de4d007953f7c38f25",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I saw a shooting star earlier. I like to pretend it's MARILDA stopping by to check on us.$h",
      "translation": "Před chvílí jsem viděla padající hvězdu. Ráda si představuji, že se u nás zastavila MARILDA, aby se podívala, jak se nám daří.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "114702a57b12cca6bb6cf62447fd3d66d1d38bfa5c21d119657fe8ac7c2f2118",
      "translationSHA256": "4739049c0f98df08029ca1ba7ea37abea3946eb83ca3d7c0464e6fa8c22c677a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I can't decide if I'm craving chocolate cake or ripe strawberries. Or maybe both...?#$e#Be honest... am I gaining weight?$s",
      "translation": "Nemohu se rozhodnout, jestli mám chuť na čokoládový dort, nebo zralé jahody. Nebo možná na obojí...?#$e#Upřímně... přibírám?$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "8ed0c4fb6206700f3f8169cbb6936ddb7e5427cfff70c8d8f6ea714be387ebe4",
      "translationSHA256": "682c976ffe54e7cd4fb6ff1e5eda2ff0fd8277b62367e0e3fc75ab80743df50b",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueMaru",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You did good work today! You deserve to relax the rest of the evening.",
      "translation": "Dnes se ti práce povedla! Po zbytek večera si zasloužíš odpočívat.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5a244ff2299d926a23a8907e10efdf90cb058da4881318fff23946834f6bb09a",
      "translationSHA256": "ffa94f4eed354e5d4e8db950f1737d10df3dcd0934dd042b02dad3c135dc2eb9",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
